WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.450
Of course my good friend
Andy Richter is here.

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.370
Hi Andy.

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:03.203
Hi Conan.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.310
How are you?

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.086
I'm doing pretty well.

00:00:06.086 --> 00:00:07.530
I'm glad to see,

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.560
this makes a big difference,

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.030
you know, we took a page
from major league sports.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:12.942
Yeah.

00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:13.775
And we got

00:00:13.775 --> 00:00:16.285
our fans to send in cardboard cutouts.

00:00:16.285 --> 00:00:17.640
[Andy] Yeah.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.640
We got so many,

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.090
and thousands and thousands of people

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.230
sent in pictures,

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.063
we printed them out

00:00:23.063 --> 00:00:24.640
and we put them here,

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.640
to give us a packed audience.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.130
[Andy] Yeah.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.260
Gotta tell you,

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:30.883
maybe it's cause it's a Monday,

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:33.350
they seem a little low energy right now.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:34.183
Yeah.

00:00:34.183 --> 00:00:35.179
It's, yeah.

00:00:35.179 --> 00:00:36.630
They're not, they don't have the same pep.

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.580
[Conan] No.
The same,

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:39.740
two dimensional pep
that they did last week.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:40.573
Yeah,

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.060
no, they seem a little flat.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.870
Now normally we have an audience warmup,

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:46.440
and I think they could use one right now.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:47.273
I think,

00:00:47.273 --> 00:00:49.070
maybe Andy you could help me

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:50.770
whip this crowd

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:51.700
into a frenzy.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:52.533
Any thoughts?

00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:53.366
Sure, sure.

00:00:53.366 --> 00:00:54.740
I actually have just the thing,

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.100
if you don't mind.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.000
Yeah, not at all.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.480
Andy Rector now,

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.610
is going to warm up

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:02.530
our cardboard audience,

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.650
get them excited.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:05.483
What do you got there?

00:01:05.483 --> 00:01:06.316
All right.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:07.990
Who wants a T shirt?

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:09.770
Yeah.

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.230
Oh man, this thing got some juice.

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:13.270
[Conan] Yeah, try one.

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:14.130
Here you go.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:15.289
How about you Comey?

00:01:15.289 --> 00:01:16.122
(gun explodes)

00:01:16.122 --> 00:01:17.362
Oh, yeah.

00:01:17.362 --> 00:01:18.200
Yeah.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.968
What about one of you Kevin Hart?

00:01:19.968 --> 00:01:20.801
(gun explodes)

00:01:20.801 --> 00:01:22.290
Oh, sorry lady.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:24.206
I was trying for Kevin Hart.

00:01:24.206 --> 00:01:25.454
(upbeat music)

00:01:25.454 --> 00:01:26.721
(gun explodes)

00:01:26.721 --> 00:01:27.554
(laughing)

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:28.387
[Conan] Oh.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:29.220
Hey look,

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:30.400
you hit one Kevin Hart

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.980
and you knocked down three of them.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.350
[Andy] That's the way it goes.

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:34.430
Hey, you know what,

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:36.420
get one of these guys
who's being a wise ass.

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.500
Find someone who's being

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.010
kind of a wise ass.

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:40.800
Let's see.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.766
[Conan] Oh my God.

00:01:41.766 --> 00:01:42.599
Look at this guy right here.

00:01:42.599 --> 00:01:43.432
[Conan] Yeah.

00:01:43.432 --> 00:01:44.847
Hey, why no smile buddy?

00:01:44.847 --> 00:01:46.109
(gun explodes)

00:01:46.109 --> 00:01:48.359
(laughing)

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:50.280
They're picking up Andy,

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:52.030
I can feel the energy rising.

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:53.810
They're pretty happy now,

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:54.859
right Reverend?

00:01:54.859 --> 00:01:55.692
(gun explodes)

00:01:55.692 --> 00:01:57.942
(laughing)

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:00.833
Yeah.

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:02.723
I still wanna try and get Comey good.

00:02:02.723 --> 00:02:03.556
(gun explodes)

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.410
Oh, you've got to get Comey.

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:07.930
He has to pay for his.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.924
Yeah, what about our emails now?

00:02:09.924 --> 00:02:10.757
(gun explodes)

00:02:10.757 --> 00:02:11.940
Boom, yes,

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.659
there he goes.

00:02:13.659 --> 00:02:14.990
(clapping)

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:16.080
Justice.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:19.360
(upbeat music)

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.193
[Conan] Don't act.

00:02:20.193 --> 00:02:21.026
How about this guy?

00:02:21.026 --> 00:02:23.258
Don't act like I don't see you Kevin Hart.

00:02:23.258 --> 00:02:24.740
(upbeat music)

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:25.573
[Conan] Wait,

00:02:25.573 --> 00:02:26.541
he actually.

00:02:26.541 --> 00:02:27.965
(laughing)

00:02:27.965 --> 00:02:29.220
[Andy] He stood back up.

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.873
You stood him back up.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.111
I think they're pretty pumped now.

00:02:34.111 --> 00:02:34.944
(Clapping)

00:02:34.944 --> 00:02:35.777
[Conan] Nice job, Andy.

00:02:35.777 --> 00:02:37.130
I know I am.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.110
[Conan] Nice job.

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:39.390
Man, man.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:41.300
It's like fun as I've had in awhile.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.120
Well, sorry Kevin.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.423
Seriously, sorry buddy.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.250
Well that's how we repay fans

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.999
that take the time to
send us their photos.

00:02:50.999 --> 00:02:51.832
(laughing)

00:02:51.832 --> 00:02:53.180
We blast them in the face

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:54.760
with a T shirt cannon

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:55.870
at close range.

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:58.120
They got T shirts out of the deal.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.520
That may look,

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.660
unfriendly,

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.090
but I promise you

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:03.650
every fan that was hit

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.090
we're gonna send them

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:07.916
a photograph of the T shirt.

00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:09.500
(laughing)

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.596
And then they can have it
made into a cardboard cutout.

00:03:11.596 --> 00:03:12.960
A cardboard cutout of a T shirt.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:13.793
[Conan] Yeah.

